    {
      "q": "What is waste management?",
      "a": "Waste management is the term used to describe how you collect, transport, dispose of, and recycle waste.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "What are the steps for managing waste?",
      "a": "The steps are: Avoid (do we need it?), Reduce (do we need so much?), Reuse (can we use it again?), and Recycle (can someone else use it or can it be converted into something new?).",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "What are the risks of improper waste disposal?",
      "a": "Businesses face large fines, and individuals can face large fines and jail sentences of several years.",
